  <title type="string">Against the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding</title>
  <description type="string">Wanjiru Tanaka talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
